Management\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExceptional Emergency and Specialty Pet Care Close to Home\nMedVet Cleveland is a premier animal emergency and specialty hospital in the Cleveland area. Our highly trained team serves as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care.\nServing more than 18,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing you and your pet compassion. Our team has the expertise to skillfully deal with any pet emergency and provide advanced specialty care for your pet with the goal of getting your pet home to you in the best health.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Cleveland Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nOur Hospital Leaders\nDiane Wilson, DVM, MS, MRCVS, DACVAA\nMedical Director\nKrista Poston, RVT\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nAbby Brenner\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChase Byers\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKelly Catanzaro\n, DVM, PhD, Diplomate, ACVM (Bacteriology)\nEmergency Medicine\nRose Cherry Vogel\n, DVM, DACVO\n®\nOphthalmology\nMallory Clouse\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Neurology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nEllen Kuerbitz\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nVionna Kwan\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nSarah Lorbach\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nCharles McBrien\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nRachel Metz\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMitchell Oakes\n, DVM, PhD\nEmergency Medicine\nNicolette Ornelas\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nRochelle Prudic\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nMary Ryan\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine, Urgent Care\nSarah Shane\n, DVM, MS, DACVAA\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nDebra Sloan\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAdam Townsend\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nDiane Wilson\n, MS, DVM, MRCVS, DACVAA\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAnastasia (Sia) Young\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBenjamin Zucker\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n20\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nMy six-year-old Pomeranian chihuahua suffered a proptosed eye injury – absolutely freaky and horrifying. The receptionist immediately noticed and radioed for ER. I thought my dog was losing his eye. These miracle workers took amazing care of my baby boy, reassured me about post-op care, they handle critical patients with quickness and grace.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye 